description: Enforce modular folder structure
alwaysApply: true
---

# Modular folder structure

- Routes → `src/pages/` (thin)
- Interactive flows → `src/features/<domain>/`
- Pure logic (shuffle, filter, board, Excel row parsing) → `src/lib/`
- Server data cache → `src/store/`
- Types → `src/types/`; enums / thresholds → `src/constants/`
- Move to global only when ≥ 2 features share it
- No barrel `index.ts` for components
